WEBVTT

51:01.627 --> 51:05.047
If Khal Drogo has promised you a crown,
you shall have it.

51:05.172 --> 51:08.216
- When?
- When their omens favor war.

51:09.343 --> 51:11.887
I piss on Dothraki omens.

51:12.012 --> 51:14.681
I've waited 17 years to get my throne back.

51:24.024 --> 51:27.027
- (CROWD ULULATING)
- (GRUNTING)
